When you're running your rife machine, this is why we typically recommend when you hit run on your rife machine to close your computer.

00:01:50,260 --> 00:01:59,260
When you close your computer, you're putting your computer to sleep because as soon as you hit run on the computer, it sends the program to the generator.

00:01:59,260 --> 00:02:15,260
It sends the program to the F170 or F122. You don't need the computer anymore once you hit run. You could unplug the computer and you could burger to the other room. It will still run the program. The program has been sent to the generator to run.

