I know I know a lot of people like to look at the program on the computer and look at the frequency that's running and look at the countdown of the time and all that kind of stuff.

00:02:24,260 --> 00:02:37,260
Don't do that. And the reason why I say don't do that is when you have the computer open, you are actually exposing yourself to EFFs because every computer produces, you know, EFFs. You don't need that.

00:02:37,260 --> 00:02:44,260
Secondly, you are exposing the computer to the frequencies from the rife machine.

00:02:44,260 --> 00:02:53,260
